---
// Sección Aliados Estratégicos - estilo grid de sponsors tailwindcss.com
---
<section class="relative overflow-hidden py-20 px-4 md:px-8 bg-[#0a0a0a]">
  <!-- Patrón hatch diagonal en los márgenes (estilo Tailwind) -->
  <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-[repeating-linear-gradient(45deg,rgba(255,255,255,0.05)_0,rgba(255,255,255,0.05)_1px,transparent_1px,transparent_6px)] pointer-events-none"></div>

  <div class="relative max-w-6xl mx-auto">
    <div class="text-center mb-12">
      <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-white mb-3">Aliados Estratégicos</h2>
      <p class="text-white/70 text-lg mb-4">Respaldados por nuestros sponsors</p>
      <p class="text-white/50 max-w-2xl mx-auto">SportDharma Ecosystem cuenta con el apoyo de patrocinadores alineados a nuestra esencia que hacen posible mantener la página a tiempo completo.</p>
    </div>

    <!-- Botón estilo Tailwind -->
    <div class="mb-6">
      <a href="mailto:contact@sportdharmaecosystem.com?subject=Sponsorship%20SportDharma%20Ecosystem" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-full border border-white/15 px-4 py-2 text-sm text-white/70 transition-colors hover:border-white/40 hover:text-white">
        Convertite en sponsor
        <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M5 12h14M12 5l7 7-7 7"/></svg>
      </a>
    </div>

    <!-- Grid con líneas divisorias finas (gap-px + bg-línea) -->
    <div class="rounded-2xl border border-white/10 overflow-hidden">
      <div class="grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-4 gap-px bg-white/10">
        <div class="group flex h-32 md:h-40 items-center justify-center bg-[#0a0a0a] transition-colors hover:bg-white/[0.03]">
          <span class="font-black text-2xl tracking-tight text-white/60 transition-colors group-hover:text-white">alpine<span class="font-light">gear.</span></span>
        </div>
        <div class="group flex h-32 md:h-40 items-center justify-center bg-[#0a0a0a] transition-colors hover:bg-white/[0.03]">
          <span class="font-black text-2xl tracking-widest text-white/60 transition-colors group-hover:text-white">TRAILTECH</span>
        </div>
        <div class="group flex h-32 md:h-40 items-center justify-center bg-[#0a0a0a] transition-colors hover:bg-white/[0.03]">
          <span class="font-black text-2xl tracking-tight text-white/60 transition-colors group-hover:text-white">Eco<span class="font-light">Ride</span></span>
        </div>
        <div class="group flex h-32 md:h-40 items-center justify-center bg-[#0a0a0a] transition-colors hover:bg-white/[0.03]">
          <span class="font-black text-2xl tracking-tight text-white/60 transition-colors group-hover:text-white">Summit<span class="font-light">Labs</span></span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>